  "name": {
   "zh": "动作生成 · Kimodo",
   "en": "Motion Generation · Kimodo"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Kimodo 是在 700 小时可商用光学动捕上训练的运动学动作扩散模型，由文字描述生成人体和机器人动作。这张卡不用素材：写一句英文描述、定好帧范围，默认重定目标到「标准人」（SMPL-X 体型，非商用且需注册）；商用请换成导入的 FBX / USD 角色或选「原骨架」（G1 机器人要选它）；模型选 SMPL-X 时仅限研究。",
   "en": "Kimodo is a kinematic motion diffusion model trained on 700 hours of commercially usable optical mocap, generating human and robot motion from text. No footage needed: write an English description and set the frame range. By default it retargets to Standard Human (SMPL-X, non-commercial, registration required); for commercial use pick an imported FBX / USD character or Original Skeleton (required for G1)."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-22T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "motion_gen",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
